---
description: UI boundary rule for generated components
globs: "components/ui/**"
alwaysApply: false
---

Files in this folder are generated by v0 using tailwind or inspected via the Figma MCP
server. Treat them as presentation-only wrappers — never add data
fetching, Supabase calls, or business logic here. Move that logic into
a Server Action (`app/actions/`) or a hook (`hooks/`), then pass the
result down as props.